sd-22-dmsms pack: content licence
====================================

This pack is derived from:
  SD-22 DMSMS Guidebook
  SD-22, 06-JAN-2026 (cover dated December 2025)
  Defense Standardization Program Office (DSPO)

Source licence: Public Domain (US Government work, 17 U.S.C. 105); Distribution A,
approved for public release; distribution unlimited. (tier 1; see ../../docs/SOURCE-VETTING.md)
No source-material download link is published (see ../../docs/LICENSING.md).

This source is a work of the United States Government, prepared by the Defense
Standardization Program Office, and therefore is NOT subject to copyright protection
in the United States (17 U.S.C. 105). Distribution A is taken from ASSIST metadata for
ident 275490. No printed DOPSR case was found. The cover text layer has no
copyright notice.

This pack does not reproduce tables, figures, risk grids, checklists, cost surveys,
or appendix worksheets cell by cell. DoD issuances and statutes are named, not quoted.

